[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0010","text":"啊……\n路加酱……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0020","text":"呼——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0030","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0040","text":"哈气，是白的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0050","text":"那又怎么了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0060","text":"我就在想，现在好冷啊。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0080","text":"我们明明这么冷，还要努力工作和训练，\n真了不起呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0090","text":"呼——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_03_0100","text":"…………"}]
